{"sba-keyaki-1297":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日発売のSamurai ELOに載せていただいてます!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またださせていただいて本当に嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"編集部の皆さんが本当に面白くて。撮影が本当に楽しくて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また早くお逢いできたらいいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非是非お手にとってください(*^｡^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オフショット"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG389JYJWM15574B560A60K","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG38AQC9CQYTG486E18E2JP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服も可愛い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服でも着たいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ELOの撮影の服は本当にドストライクが多いです。( ⸝⸝･໐･⸝⸝ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影の合間に用意してもらったたくさんの服をチラチラみて。チェックしてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これほしー。これも欲しい。って(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でわ。(*^｡^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなか"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-sakura-41097":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"             \n \n \n \n \n \n ブログを開いて下さりありがとうございます。櫻坂46の関有美子です🐱\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG3NQQG2CAQYE7TME9Z040D","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n #ゆみこかめら\n \n \n 9月19日、20日に開催された\n 『櫻坂46 1st TOUR 2021』愛知公演に足を運んでくださった皆さん、本当にありがとうございました☺︎\n \n \n \n どうでしたか？楽しんでいただけたかな。\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG3NRRA5R14YNAR269Q57R3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 愛知公演の2日目では髪型をいつもの外ハネから変えてみました。\n ちょっと巻いてもらいました！\n \n 伝わるかな。\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG3NSZEQN6XNF2RCG02ZGA0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n メイクもアイラインが黒のキャットラインだったり、リップもちょっと赤系だったり。\n 見た目が少しでも変わると気持ちも変わるものですね！\n 大阪はどうしようかなー☺︎\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n そして\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG3NTZWSX44C5AYA9ZSBHF5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG3NW3KK4JP2DRG0YAKJSXP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 可愛い子たちに会いました。🐸🐥\n かわいい！！！\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG3NXEVDAWP9D0YXXKCBPV9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n ツアーのグッズ！\n これ前回のブログに載せたかったのに忘れてました。\n わたしあるある。\n 載せたかった写真、書きたかった話をすぐ忘れる。\n \n \n \n \n \n 愛知で全く写真を撮ってなくて、メンバーとの写真がなくてごめんなさい😢\n 大阪ではたくさん撮るぞ！\n \n \n \n \n そしてユニゾンエアーさんが2周年を迎えましたー！\n みなさんいつも遊んでくれてありがとう☺︎\n \n 2周年SHOWROOMにも呼んでいただき、たくさんお話ししたり初公開の情報なども発表させていただきました。\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG3NYEWMSTVYDF2EKG6GEDM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n まりな、ゆいちゃん、きらちゃん。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG3NZFP7MFN0YSQ08QVH0W9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG3P0FTTG700HRKKBBGJ36B","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n ガチャであたったら教えてねー。\n 髪型を編み込みにしたんです☺︎\n \n \n \n \n \n \n 大丈夫かな。書き忘れ、載せ忘れないかな。\n 心配だけど終わりたいと思います。\n \n \n \n 次は大阪です！\n 楽しもうねー☺︎\n \n \n \n \n じゃあ、今日はここまでです！\n \n \n 最後までお読みいただきありがとうございました！\n \n \n 関有美子🐱             "}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-16527":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんのコメント"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一つ一つじっくり読んでます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"涙なしには読めなかった..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もぉ、電車で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泣かせるなよぉ〜(´°ω°｀)ばかぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもみなさん一人一人が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のことを応援してくれてて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"支えてくれてるんだってことを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心から実感して、今一度"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気を引き締めて頑張っていこう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思えました(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ反映されてない分は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"されたら読ませてもらうねっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうやって、お互いに高め合える"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんとの関係ってすごく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵だなぁと思うヽ(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は8thで5回目の選抜入りです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今三列目のあのポジションに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なって改めて冷静に考えると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ私に足りないところを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見つめ直して、伸ばすべきだって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ことに気づかせてくれた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大切な期間でもあります☆"},{"ty